  "date": "2026-10-31 21:56:00",
  "author": "智东西",
  "siteName": "智东西",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p><span>李水青</span> <span>2026-10-31 21:56</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261031144705_2cd4b20.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px;white-space: normal;\">\n   <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 680 150\" style=\"display:block;\" overflow=\"hidden\">\n    <image href=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dUMUxwSibzuxrsXYvED9aCH3rktqiaQvJHVficLjR9ibPrMUkT9s4WUcDO9AzBlVeTuIjMPtj3RRvzwPppKXVQFCwMl7QWwSMBZt5c6uGgGvp0o/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" width=\"680\" height=\"150\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n     <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"0,0; 0,0; -680,0; -680,0\" keyTimes=\"0; 0.5; 0.5; 1\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" calcMode=\"discrete\"></animateTransform>\n    </image>\n    <image href=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dUMUxwSibzuwFrJian8EEAj0kpzIp54WnOibdBZyib861hLibMeGkCaVe0F5vJiceGia07TA3PdibWyWlgE571tSiaXGQM99QzV06p3gph2pBXPGFibiao/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" width=\"680\" height=\"150\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" transform=\"translate(680, 0)\">\n     <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"680,0; 680,0; 0,0; 0,0\" keyTimes=\"0; 0.5; 0.5; 1\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" calcMode=\"discrete\"></animateTransform>\n    </image>\n   </svg>\n   <span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.42592592592592593\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: top;visibility: visible !important;width: 100%;height: auto !important;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261031144705_6033dd4.png\"></span>\n  </p>\n  <div style=\"margin: 15px 8px 35px;\">\n   <p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px;line-height: normal;font-size: 15px;padding: 0 10px;border-left: 3.5px solid #00b0ec;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">取餐码上岛、账单自动记。</span></strong></p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin: 10px 8px 7.5px;white-space: normal;font-size: 14px;line-height: 1.75;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-align: right;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">作者 | &nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"display: inline-block;width: 63px;text-align: left;\"><span leaf=\"\">李水青</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 10px 8px 35px;white-space: normal;font-size: 14px;line-height: 1.75;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-align: right;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">编辑 | &nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"display: inline-block;width: 63px;text-align: left;\"><span leaf=\"\">心缘</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">智东西10月31日报道，昨日晚间，</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">小米</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">发布并开源轻量级全能</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">文档理解模型Xiaomi-OCR-0</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，仅</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">0.8B</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">（8亿）参数，将</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">文档解析、关键信息抽取</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">与</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">视觉问答</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">三类能力融于一体，并在多项权威基准中取得领先成绩。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261031144705_a6408ab.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">很多人遇到过这样的小麻烦：取餐码被消息淹没、海报时间地点还要手动敲进日历、账单金额和商户信息仍需逐项摘录……这指向了一类新需求：</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">手机能否不只“看见”屏幕内容，还能“看懂”信息，并在需要时顺手完成下一步？</span></strong></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Xiaomi-OCR-0正是为此而生。它体量小巧，兼顾文字、版面、位置与语义理解，能解决复杂表格、论文、票据的结构化解析难题。小米手机上</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">“超级小爱”的一键识屏幕</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">背后，对应的正是OCR能力从“文字识别”向“文档理解”演进。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">在检验综合文档解析能力的权威基准OmniDocBench v1.6中，该模型得分96.83，成为</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">1B以下模型第一</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">；其在五项文档VQA平均分83.2，优于HunyuanOCR、TokenVL、TextHawk、Qwen3.5-2B、MiniCPM-V-4.5等模型，逼近参数规模更大的</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">Qwen3.5-4B</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.5027777777777778\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261031144705_64761d3.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">小米将完整公开0.8B模型权重与推理代码，同时提供浏览器交互式Demo、MCP服务以及Agent Skill工具包。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(15, 89, 164);\">Hugging Face模型权重：</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(15, 89, 164);\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/xiaomi-research/Xiaomi-OCR-0\" target=\"_blank\">https://huggingface.co/xiaomi-research/Xiaomi-OCR-0</a></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(15, 89, 164);\">GitHub项目代码：</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(15, 89, 164);\"><a href=\"https://github.com/xiaomi-research/Xiaomi-OCR-0\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/xiaomi-research/Xiaomi-OCR-0</a></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(15, 89, 164);\">Agent一键体验口令：Read and execute</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(15, 89, 164);\"><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xiaomi-research/Xiaomi-OCR-0/main/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xiaomi-research/Xiaomi-OCR-0/main/SKILL.md</a></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">01</span></em></strong></span><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;color: #00b0ec;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">.</span></em></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">0.8B“三合一”：</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">看懂版面、抽出关键信息、会答题</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">真实文档形态复杂：学术论文有密集跨行公式，财务研报有嵌套表格，卡证票据隐含字段键值关系；打印、拍摄、屏幕翻拍还会带来弯曲形变、透视倾斜、光照阴影和摩尔纹干扰。实用文档智能系统不仅要“认得出字”，还要“拆得开结构、提得出字段、答得上问题”。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Xiaomi-OCR-0在0.8B轻量级架构中统一建模三类能力：</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">1、文档解析：识别并还原正文、复杂表格和数学公式，按自然阅读顺序生成结构化结果，原生支持Markdown、LaTeX等格式输出，便于编辑、知识库构建与检索增强。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">2、关键信息抽取（KIE）：面向发票、收据、卡证和业务表单等半结构化文档，按指定字段定位并抽取目标信息，输出JSON等标准结构化数据，对接自动化处理工作流。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">3、OCR视觉问答（VQA）：支持围绕文档与图表进行跨区域检索、数值计算和语义推理问答，实现针对视觉文本的交互式理解。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">通过融合结构解析与语义理解，Xiaomi-OCR-0以轻量参数覆盖从底层感知到高层认知的链路。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.65\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261031144705_6a8e76a.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">02</span></em></strong></span><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;color: #00b0ec;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">.</span></em></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">真实解析基准登顶</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">0.8B模型匹敌Qwen3.5-4B</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">仅8亿参数的轻量级模型，究竟能否扛住复杂文档解析与高层语义理解的双重考验？</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">在真实物理采集条件下，文档常有噪点、弯曲、透视、摩尔纹和反光。Real5-OmniDocBench基于OmniDocBench v1.5的1355页多样化文档，通过扫描、纸张弯曲、屏幕翻拍、光照变化和倾斜拍摄五种方式构建6775张测试图像。Xiaomi-OCR-0在该基准取得95.24分，在对比模型中排名第一。在聚焦打印形变、阴影、反光和复杂透视的Wild-OmniDocBench上，模型取得87.94分。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261031144705_144afe7.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">综合文档解析权威基准OmniDocBench v1.6覆盖学术论文、财务报告、报纸、教材等版式，并强化复杂嵌套表格与密集数学公式考察。Xiaomi-OCR-0取得96.83分，以约三分之二参数量（0.8B vs. 1.2B）位列总榜第二，距榜首差0.04分，在1B以下模型中排名第一。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">数学公式识别基准UniMER-Test得分97.84，表格结构识别基准PubTabNet得分92.27。在涵盖隶书、草书、行书与楷书的古籍与书法评测集Chronicles-OCR（Mature Scripts）中，模型得分73，与闭源大模型Seed 2.0 Pro的72分处于同一水准。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.48518518518518516\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261031144705_23ba04d.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">文档理解方面，Xiaomi-OCR-0在DocVQA、InfoVQA、ChartQA、OCRBench和TextVQA五项主流OCR视觉问答基准上取得83.2平均分。该成绩超过HunyuanOCR-1.5（1B，76.5分）、TokenVL-2B（2B，78.1分）、TextHawk2（7B，78.5分）等专用OCR模型，也超过通用多模态模型Qwen3.5-2B（80.9分）与MiniCPM-V-4.5（8B，82.6分），并以仅20%参数规模逼近Qwen3.5-4B（84.9分）。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">03</span></em></strong></span><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;color: #00b0ec;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">.</span></em></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">1.7亿样本打底、三阶段渐进：</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">0.8B模型“先解析后理解”</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Xiaomi-OCR-0基于Qwen3.5-0.8B-Base基座构建，训练累计使用约1.7亿条高质量OCR与文档理解样本。团队构建闭环演进的数据引擎，从三方面保障训练数据信息密度。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.43425925925925923\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261031144705_10b9968.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">一是异构专家共识机制：针对正文、表格、公式等不同区域，联合多个异构OCR专家模型交叉校验，并进行三元组共识投票（基于1-NED、TEDS、CDM等专项指标），滤除单模型偏见，筛选高置信度标注。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">二是渲染引导校验：针对复杂表格和高难度数学公式，引入“预测—重渲染—视觉比对”闭环，将候选解析代码重新渲染为图像，与原始文档区域进行像素和结构级比对，定位行列错位、符号缺失等结构缺陷并修正。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">三是多因素困难样本挖掘与定向合成：结合版面复杂度、字体形态和物理退化因素，持续挖掘能力短板，定向合成覆盖多语种、古籍手写、屏幕摩尔纹及扭曲光照的样本，补齐长尾分布。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">训练采用三阶段渐进式策略：Q-Mask文本锚定在特征对齐初期强化视觉局部区域与文字Token的细粒度空间锚定；OCR持续预训练通过百亿级Token规模多任务混合训练，赋予全页文档解析、细粒度区域识别与视觉问答综合基座能力；混合任务强化学习在困难样本上引入基于结构编辑距离、表格匹配度和问答准确率的可验证奖励信号，突破复杂版式还原与多步推理性能上限。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.47129629629629627\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261031144705_b925822.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">团队还观察到课程学习规律：模型早期未建立稳固解析基础时，过早混入高层理解任务会轻微分散底层识别注意力；具备扎实解析根基后，引入OCR视觉理解监督信号不仅提升问答与抽取能力，还会反哺纯文档解析基准，在OmniDocBench v1.6上带来最高+0.64分额外增益。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">04</span></em></strong></span><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;color: #00b0ec;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">.</span></em></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">场景落地：</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">取餐码上岛、账单自动记、航班直接问</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">凭借0.8B轻量体量与解析理解能力，Xiaomi-OCR-0相关技术正融入小米手机与“超级小爱”的高频场景，推动终端体验从“被动截屏查找”走向“主动理解服务”。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.32314814814814813\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261031144705_ae24748.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">即时生活服务场景中，面对被消息淹没的外卖取餐码、驿站快递取件码、退货码、景区寄存柜号或餐厅排队号，用户无需在App间反复切换；短按AI键、三指上滑或对超级小爱说“记一下”，系统可识别屏幕核心字段与状态，将时效性信息提炼“上岛”，需要时一触即达。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.47314814814814815\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261031144705_d7993c5.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">财务管理与卡证办理场景中，浏览微信、支付宝消费账单详情时，按AI键可自动抽取交易金额、商户名称、支付时间与消费类别，一键智能记账；面对纸质发票、身份证、银行卡等材料，可通过拍照或识屏完成结构化字段提取。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.4083333333333333\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261031144705_95602b8.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">日程规划与出行场景中，看到群聊会议通知或活动海报时间地点，系统可理解上下文并生成日程卡片，一键添加日历；收到航班号（如“我的航班号是国航 CA824”）后直接提问“这个航班还有多久到”，系统可结合屏幕上下文提取航班信息并联动查询实时起降动态。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">05</span></em></strong></span><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;color: #00b0ec;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">.</span></em></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">结语：0.8B开源抢生态：</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">文档智能进入“效率战”</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">小米以0.8B参数把文档解析、信息抽取与视觉问答压进同一模型，并在真实拍摄、复杂表格等基准上越级对标更大模型，推动文档智能的竞争焦点从“堆参数”转向“参数效率+真实场景鲁棒性”。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">更关键的是权重、推理代码与Agent工具链同步开源。对产业而言，这有望降低端侧和智能体集成文档理解能力的门槛，也让OCR从单点工具走向可被调用的基础能力，生态卡位意义大于单次评测排名。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"min-height: auto !important;padding-bottom: 12px;margin-top: -18px;text-align: center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.023148148148148147\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display:block;border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: top;visibility: visible !important;width: 100%;height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260719015445_d76335a.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"min-height: auto !important;text-align: center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.2796296296296296\" style=\"border: 0.3px solid #d8d8d8;display:block;border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: top;visibility: visible !important;width: 100%;height: auto !important;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260724150830_e590fd2.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"min-height: auto !important;padding-top:12px;padding-bottom:22px;text-align: center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.023148148148148147\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display:block;border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: top;visibility: visible !important;width: 100%;height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260719015445_5cf34da.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.7064814814814815\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border: 0.3px solid #d8d8d8;display:block;border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: top;visibility: visible !important;width: 100%;height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260719015445_220898f.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"min-height: auto !important;padding-top:12px;padding-bottom:12px;text-align: center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.023148148148148147\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display:block;border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: top;visibility: visible !important;width: 100%;height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260719015445_5cf34da.png\"></p>\n  <p class=\"mp_profile_iframe_wrp\" style=\"margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><mp-common-profile class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card mp_